# EMS frontend system

Keep every new UI aligned with the official Kenya election-operations look.

## Brand
- Colors: green `#006B3F` / `#073322` / `#0E7A45`, red `#BB0A21`, gold `#C9A227`, black `#111111`, white `#FFFFFF`.
- Default theme is **light**.
- Do not print the word **IEBC** on the login page.
- Do not use the old flag SVG mark on login.

## Login page
- Match the split-card reference: floating rounded frame, dark-green left panel, white right panel.
- Font: **Inter**. Left headline ~64px / 800. Sign In ~42px / 700. Inputs 16px, 56px tall, fully rounded.
- Placeholders inside pill fields. Green pill Sign In button.
- Keep existing copy: Election Management, authorised officer access, official email, password.

## Voice
- Professional, short, government-grade copy. Avoid startup slogans and “PRO / v4.0” chrome.
